    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20899" root="سنح" body-key="s">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَسْحْتُهُ عَنْ كَذَا</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسَنَّحْتُهُ</span></b> , <i>i. q.</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَفْصَحْتُهُ</span> [meaning <i>I asked him,</i> or <i>desired him,
to explain such a thing</i>]: (O, K:) and so
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَنْحَسْتُهُ عن كذا</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَحَّسْتُهُ</span>. (TA.)

